      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The Government Security Classifications Policy (GSCP) was updated on the 30 June 2023. The Policy applies to any information or data that is created, processed, stored or managed as part of a HMG contract. The contents of this Procurement Policy Note (PPN) apply to all Central Government Departments, their Executive Agencies, Non-Departmental Public Bodies and NHS bodies. These organisations are referred to in this PPN as ‘In-Scope Organisations’.",
